      an enemy does while it waits for its turn: one slow move around its target,
      then a short rest, always facing it.\n\nIt keeps asking for the turn the whole
      time, and ends the moment the turn is granted, so the Attack branch above takes
      it. It also ends after one move, so the root looks at its other branches between
      two moves.\n\nA walk that cannot arrive is given up after two seconds.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"425b84af-69f7-485d-b7c0-90324022efdd","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"$ref":"73"},{"VariableKind":"Graph","NodeComment":null,"relations":{"$content":[],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ConnectionCollection`3[[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPortRelation,
